    "detailed_description": "Rise through the ages.<br>In Profectus you start with nothing but a world to explore. Your goal is to use what you are given to the fullest extent and work your way up from the stone age into space.<br><br>Profectus is unique in that you do not start with an inventory, you have to carry everything you own in your hands, on your hips or on your back.<br>Maybe one day, you'll learn how to domesticate packanimals.<br><br>The current version of this game, although not nearly what it will be one day, includes:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Seed generated breakable terrain with stylized water physics<br></li><li> An age system which limits buildable structures according to which age you are in<br></li><li> The first three ages, this being: Stone age, Bronze age, Iron age<br></li><li> simple storage in form of bundles<br></li><li> Wood and Brick as a means of building simple structures<br></li><li> Multiplayer</li></ul>",
